<i>I'm sorry, please forgive me</i>

1569
01:35:05.958 --> 01:35:08.791
<i>I'm sorry, please forgive me</i>

1570
01:35:09.166 --> 01:35:11.958
<i>I'm sorry, please forgive me</i>

1571
01:35:12.291 --> 01:35:15.375
<i>I'm a changed man, you'll see</i>

1572
01:35:27.041 --> 01:35:30.750
<i>Your heart is clear as water</i>

1573
01:35:30.833 --> 01:35:33.916
<i>So pristine and pure</i>

1574
01:35:34.000 --> 01:35:37.625
<i>Yet, I never looked within</i>

1575
01:35:38.000 --> 01:35:40.791
<i>Couldn't understand your soul</i>

1576
01:35:41.166 --> 01:35:46.791
<i>I was hypnotized</i>
<i>By your kohl-stained eyes</i>

1577
01:35:47.583 --> 01:35:50.375
<i>But I never looked inside</i>

1578
01:35:50.708 --> 01:35:53.833
<i>Never looked into your soul</i>

1579
01:35:54.208 --> 01:35:59.958
<i>Should've known from the start</i>

1580
01:36:00.583 --> 01:36:05.250
<i>That I can't bear to be apart</i>

1581
01:36:06.166 --> 01:36:09.250
<i>I bow at your feet</i>

1582
01:36:09.583 --> 01:36:12.375
<i>With folded hands</i>

1583
